  "description": "Amorthe is where timeless elegance meets modern versatility—a typeface that speaks with sophistication and charm across languages, including Cyrillic, Greek, and more. Its refined serifs are brought to life with playful alternates that add a whisper of personality to every letterform.\nWith nine carefully crafted weights, from whisper-thin grace to bold confidence, Amorthe adapts seamlessly to everything from headlines to body text. It balances classic beauty with a fresh, contemporary edge, making it ideal for luxury branding, editorial layouts, and high-end packaging—think fine wine, artisanal chocolates, signature perfumes, and premium skincare.\nIf Amorthe were a person, she’d be Audrey Hepburn—graceful, multilingual, and full of subtle surprises that reveal themselves with every glance.\nAll glyphs and swashes are PUA encoded, making them simple to use in any design software.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Amorthe is where timeless elegance meets modern versatility—a typeface that speaks with sophistication and charm across languages, including Cyrillic, Greek, and more. Its refined serifs are brought to life with playful alternates that add a whisper of personality to every letterform.</p>\n<p>With nine carefully crafted weights, from whisper-thin grace to bold confidence, Amorthe adapts seamlessly to everything from headlines to body text. It balances classic beauty with a fresh, contemporary edge, making it ideal for luxury branding, editorial layouts, and high-end packaging—think fine wine, artisanal chocolates, signature perfumes, and premium skincare.</p>\n<p>If Amorthe were a person, she’d be Audrey Hepburn—graceful, multilingual, and full of subtle surprises that reveal themselves with every glance.<br>\nAll glyphs and swashes are PUA encoded, making them simple to use in any design software.</p>",
